ata-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.70.10953<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 12, 2021<br/>Summer Update 2021</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210526224023&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Strike_Enhancement_760bdc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a strike enhancement.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.10 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Drinking this potion temporarily increases critical hit chance.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Drinking this potion will increase the <a href=\"#/wiki/Critical%20Hit\">Critical Hit</a> chance by 5% for one hour.<br/>\nThis potion can be obtained every two weeks by either ranking among the top 20 in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibiadrome\">Tibiadrome</a> leaderboards or by being raffled among the remaining participants.<br/>\nThere is a cooldown of 24 hours after drinking this potion. Since this is an individual cooldown, one may stack the effects of multiple <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibiadrome\">Tibiadrome Potions</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:bot